---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<BaseHead title="About | Product Management System" description="About the product management system" />
	</head>
	<body>
		<Header />
		<main>
			<h1>📋 About This System</h1>
			
			<p>
				This is a comprehensive product management system built with modern web technologies, 
				featuring both a powerful admin interface and complete technical documentation.
			</p>

			<h2>🛠️ System Features</h2>
			<ul>
				<li><strong>Amazon-Style Admin Interface:</strong> Professional product management with drag-and-drop image uploads</li>
				<li><strong>Dynamic Form Management:</strong> Add/remove product sizes and colors dynamically</li>
				<li><strong>Complete Documentation System:</strong> Interactive documentation with search capabilities</li>
				<li><strong>File Location Mapping:</strong> Exact file paths and line numbers for all functions</li>
				<li><strong>Architecture Diagrams:</strong> Visual representation of system flow and components</li>
			</ul>

			<h2>🔧 Technical Stack</h2>
			<ul>
				<li><strong>Frontend:</strong> Astro, React, Tailwind CSS</li>
				<li><strong>Documentation:</strong> Interactive search system with syntax highlighting</li>
				<li><strong>UI Components:</strong> Amazon-inspired design patterns</li>
				<li><strong>File Management:</strong> Advanced file upload with preview system</li>
			</ul>

			<h2>📚 Documentation Coverage</h2>
			<p>
				The system includes comprehensive documentation covering:
			</p>
			<ul>
				<li><strong>25 Functions:</strong> 14 frontend + 10 backend + 1 database schema</li>
				<li><strong>8 Core Files:</strong> Complete file structure mapping</li>
				<li><strong>12 API Endpoints:</strong> Full endpoint documentation</li>
				<li><strong>Interactive Search:</strong> Find any function, file, or documentation instantly</li>
			</ul>

			<h2>🚀 Getting Started</h2>
			<p>
				Explore the system by visiting the <a href="/admin/add-product" style="color: #3b82f6;">admin panel</a> 
				to see the product management interface, or browse the 
				<a href="/docs" style="color: #3b82f6;">complete documentation</a> to understand the system architecture 
				and code structure.
			</p>
		</main>
		<Footer />
	</body>
